  "title": "Easy Buffalo Chicken Quesadilla",
  "description": "Quick-to-fix snack or an easy dinner using just 5 ingredients. Crank up the heat by adding more Buffalo sauce. If you don&#39;t have Oaxaca cheese, use a mild cheese like mozzarella.",
